#: desc: With the parameter A:1, DSUB also replaces text in the names of targets and variables
-v COLOR=0 -v DSUB='<A:1>$(OUT_DIR):out' test/fixtures/Makefile.dsub-names
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
out/a       Write out/a
out/b       Write b (after out/a)
plain       A target without the variable in its name

-----------------------
Command-line arguments:
-----------------------
out_FLAGS   Flags used for the files in out
-----------------------
